#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:372
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_GymGuideAdvice"
msgid ""
"Yo, how's it going, CHAMPION-bound\n"
"{PLAYER}?\p"
"The GYM LEADERS here use\n"
"PSYCHIC-type POKéMON.\p"
"If you go up against them with\n"
"FIGHTING- or POISON-type POKéMON,\l"
"they'll inflict horrible damage!\p"
"Plus, they'll come at you with\n"
"outstanding combination attacks.\p"
"If you want to win, you'll need to show\n"
"them how tight you are with your\l"
"POKéMON. Go for it!$"
msgstr ""
"哟，过得怎么样，\n"
"立志成为冠军的{PLAYER}？\p"
"这里的道馆馆主使用的是\n"
"超能力属性的宝可梦。\p"
"如果你派出格斗属性或毒属性的\n"
"宝可梦和它们对战，\l"
"会受到可怕的伤害！\p"
"而且，他们还会用\n"
"出色的组合攻击来对付你。\p"
"想赢的话，就要让他们看看\n"
"你和宝可梦有多么默契。\l"
"加油吧！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:386
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_GymGuidePostVictory"
msgid ""
"Wow, you're astounding!\n"
"You're one great TRAINER!$"
msgstr ""
"哇，你太厉害了！\n"
"真是一位了不起的训练家！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:390
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_PrestonIntro"
msgid ""
"Battles hinge on the strength of your\n"
"spirit! The weak-spirited will never win!$"
msgstr ""
"对战取决于精神的强弱！\n"
"精神软弱的人是绝对赢不了的！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:394
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_PrestonDefeat"
msgid ""
"I lost!\n"
"I must temper my spirit again!$"
msgstr ""
"我输了！\n"
"我得重新磨练精神了！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:398
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_PrestonPostBattle"
msgid ""
"The indecisive lose.\n"
"That's my warning to you.$"
msgstr ""
"犹豫不决的人会输。\n"
"这是我给你的忠告。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:402
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_VirgilIntro"
msgid "Let me see your talent!$"
msgstr "让我看看你的才能吧！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:405
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_VirgilDefeat"
msgid "You possess spectacular talent!$"
msgstr "你拥有非凡的才能！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:408
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_VirgilPostBattle"
msgid ""
"If there are prodigies in the world,\n"
"then our GYM LEADERS are them!\p"
"However, you may be even more talented\n"
"than them…$"
msgstr ""
"如果世上真有天才，\n"
"那就是我们的道馆馆主！\p"
"不过，你说不定\n"
"比他们更有才能……$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:414
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_BlakeIntro"
msgid ""
"Fufufufu… Watch me levitate a POKé\n"
"BALL telekinetically!\p"
"Wrooooooooaaaar!\n"
"… … … … … … …\p"
"Sometimes, I'm out of sync…$"
msgstr ""
"呼呼呼呼……看我用念力\n"
"让精灵球飘起来！\p"
"唔哦哦哦哦哦哦哦！\n"
"…… …… …… ……\p"
"有时候我会状态失调……$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:421
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_BlakeDefeat"
msgid ""
"My POKéMON battling skills are out\n"
"of sync, too!$"
msgstr ""
"我的宝可梦对战技巧\n"
"也失调了！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:425
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_BlakePostBattle"
msgid ""
"A POKé BALL was too heavy to lift\n"
"psychically. But this dust bunny…\p"
"Whoooooooooooooooh!\n"
"… … … … … …\p"
"No, I'm not cheating!\n"
"I didn't blow on it! Honestly!$"
msgstr ""
"精灵球太重了，用念力举不起来。\n"
"不过这团灰尘……\p"
"呼哦哦哦哦哦哦哦哦！\n"
"…… …… ……\p"
"不，我没有作弊！\n"
"我没有吹它！真的！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:433
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_HannahIntro"
msgid ""
"When you lose to me, don't be too hard\n"
"on yourself.\p"
"It's not that you're weak--I'm just\n"
"too strong!$"
msgstr ""
"输给我的时候，\n"
"不要太责怪自己哦。\p"
"不是你太弱——\n"
"而是我太强了！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:439
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_HannahDefeat"
msgid "You're just too strong!$"
msgstr "你实在是太强了！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:442
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_HannahPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I'm not going to get down on myself for\n"
"losing. I just need to train harder.\p"
"Positive thinking--that's my strong\n"
"point!$"
msgstr ""
"我不会因为输了就消沉的。\n"
"只要更努力地训练就行了。\p"
"积极思考——\n"
"这就是我的长处！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:448
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_SamanthaIntro"
msgid ""
"I see it…\n"
"I see your future…\p"
"If you can beat me, I will tell you\n"
"your future!$"
msgstr ""
"我看到了……\n"
"我看到了你的未来……\p"
"如果你能打败我，\n"
"我就告诉你你的未来！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:454
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_SamanthaDefeat"
msgid "I surrender!$"
msgstr "我认输！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:457
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_SamanthaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"You will wage a terrifically intense\n"
"battle with our GYM LEADERS…\p"
"The result…\n"
"You won't hear it from me!$"
msgstr ""
"你将会和我们的道馆馆主\n"
"展开一场无比激烈的对战……\p"
"结果嘛……\n"
"我可不会告诉你！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:463
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_MauraIntro"
msgid ""
"The roads you have traveled…\n"
"What you have experienced…\p"
"Come at me with everything you've\n"
"learned!$"
msgstr ""
"你走过的道路……\n"
"你经历过的事情……\p"
"把你学到的一切\n"
"全都使出来吧！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:469
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_MauraDefeat"
msgid "You've traveled a path of greatness!$"
msgstr "你走的是一条伟大的道路！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:472
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_MauraPostBattle"
msgid ""
"A bright future awaits those who have\n"
"worked diligently.\p"
"For those who lazed idly, there is\n"
"only despair at the end.\p"
"What goes around comes around…$"
msgstr ""
"勤奋努力的人\n"
"会拥有光明的未来。\p"
"而游手好闲的人，\n"
"最后只会迎来绝望。\p"
"种什么因，就得什么果……$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:479
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_SylviaIntro"
msgid ""
"Even at the risk of life, I will win\n"
"this battle!$"
msgstr ""
"就算拼上性命，\n"
"我也要赢下这场对战！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:483
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_SylviaDefeat"
msgid ""
"What you do…\n"
"It horrifies me…$"
msgstr ""
"你的所作所为……\n"
"真让我害怕……$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:487
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_SylviaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"How dare you beat me…\p"
"It won't be my fault if something\n"
"horrible befalls you…$"
msgstr ""
"你竟敢打败我……\p"
"就算你遇到什么可怕的事情，\n"
"也不是我的错哦……$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:492
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_NateIntro"
msgid ""
"Hohoho.\p"
"You need me to show you how tenacious\n"
"the PSYCHIC type can be.$"
msgstr ""
"呵呵呵。\p"
"看来得让你见识一下\n"
"超能力属性有多么顽强了。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:497
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_NateDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh! My, my!\n"
"Your battle style is fantastic!$"
msgstr ""
"哦！哎呀呀！\n"
"你的对战风格太精彩了！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:501
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_NatePostBattle"
msgid ""
"I… I don't let defeat rattle m-me,\n"
"however b-badly.$"
msgstr ""
"我……我才不会因为输了\n"
"就动、动摇呢，不管输得多、多惨。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:505
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_KathleenIntro"
msgid ""
"Let me show you a perfectly awful,\n"
"horrifying time!$"
msgstr ""
"让我带给你一段\n"
"糟糕透顶的恐怖时光吧！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:509
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_KathleenDefeat"
msgid "N-nooooo!$"
msgstr "不、不要啊——！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:512
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_KathleenPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Your vitality is contagious!\n"
"Get away from me quickly!$"
msgstr ""
"你的活力会传染的！\n"
"快离我远一点！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:516
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_CliffordIntro"
msgid ""
"I may be past my prime, but I suggest\n"
"you not patronize me.$"
msgstr ""
"我虽然已经过了巅峰期，\n"
"但劝你还是不要小看我。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:520
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_CliffordDefeat"
msgid ""
"Ah, you overflow with the power\n"
"of youth!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，你浑身充满了\n"
"年轻的力量！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:524
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_CliffordPostBattle"
msgid ""
"It seems that I could not overcome\n"
"your youthful energy.$"
msgstr ""
"看来我终究敌不过\n"
"你年轻的活力啊。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:528
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_MaceyIntro"
msgid ""
"You're not getting through to the end!\n"
"Not if I can help it!$"
msgstr ""
"你别想走到最后！\n"
"有我在就休想！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:532
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_MaceyDefeat"
msgid ""
"How could you be so ludicrously\n"
"strong?$"
msgstr ""
"你怎么会强得\n"
"这么离谱？$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:536
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_MaceyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Humph! You may be strong, but you're\n"
"not suitable for the PSYCHIC type!\p"
"The way you battle is somehow brutal!$"
msgstr ""
"哼！你也许很强，\n"
"但你不适合超能力属性！\p"
"你的对战方式有点粗暴！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:541
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_NicholasIntro"
msgid ""
"Wroooar! Have a taste of my super\n"
"POKéMON hard-battling power!$"
msgstr ""
"唔哦哦！尝尝我超级宝可梦的\n"
"硬派对战力量吧！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:545
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_NicholasDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh!\n"
"Done in!$"
msgstr ""
"哦！\n"
"完蛋了！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:549
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_NicholasPostBattle"
msgid ""
"All right! I think I'll develop a special\n"
"invincible POKéMON power next.$"
msgstr ""
"好吧！下次我要开发一种\n"
"特别的无敌宝可梦力量。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:553
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_TateAndLizaIntro"
msgid ""
"TATE: Hehehe… Were you surprised?\p"
"LIZA: Fufufu… Were you surprised?\p"
"TATE: That there are two GYM LEADERS?\n"
"LIZA: That there are two GYM LEADERS?\p"
"TATE: We're twins!\n"
"LIZA: We're twins!\p"
"TATE: We don't need to talk because…\n"
"LIZA: We can each determine what…\p"
"TATE: The other is thinking…\n"
"LIZA: All in our minds!\p"
"TATE: This combination of ours…\n"
"LIZA: Can you beat it?$"
msgstr ""
"小枫：嘿嘿嘿……吓了一跳吧？\p"
"小南：呼呼呼……吓了一跳吧？\p"
"小枫：道馆馆主竟然有两个人？\n"
"小南：道馆馆主竟然有两个人？\p"
"小枫：我们是双胞胎！\n"
"小南：我们是双胞胎！\p"
"小枫：我们不需要说话，因为……\n"
"小南：我们都能知道……\p"
"小枫：对方在想什么……\n"
"小南：全都在心里！\p"
"小枫：我们的这个组合……\n"
"小南：你能打败吗？$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:567
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_TateAndLizaDefeat"
msgid ""
"TATE: What?! Our combination…\n"
"LIZA: Was shattered!\p"
"TATE: It can't be helped. You've won…\n"
"LIZA: So, in recognition, take this.$"
msgstr ""
"小枫：什么？！我们的组合……\n"
"小南：被打破了！\p"
"小枫：没办法，你赢了……\n"
"小南：作为认可，收下这个吧。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:573
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedMindBadge"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} received the MIND BADGE\n"
"from TATE and LIZA.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}从小枫和小南那里\n"
"得到了心灵徽章。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:577
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_ExplainMindBadgeTakeThis"
msgid ""
"TATE: The MIND BADGE enhances the\n"
"SP. ATK and SP. DEF of POKéMON.\p"
"LIZA: It also lets you use the HM move\n"
"DIVE outside of battle.\p"
"TATE: You should also take this, too.$"
msgstr ""
"小枫：心灵徽章能提高\n"
"宝可梦的特攻和特防。\p"
"小南：还能让你在对战以外\n"
"使用秘传招式潜水。\p"
"小枫：这个你也收下吧。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:584
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_ExplainCalmMind"
msgid ""
"TATE: That TM04 contains…\n"
"LIZA: CALM MIND!\p"
"TATE: It raises SP. ATK and…\n"
"LIZA: It raises SP. DEF!\p"
"TATE: It's a move that's perfect…\n"
"LIZA: For PSYCHIC POKéMON!\p"
"… … … … … …$"
msgstr ""
"小枫：这个招式学习器04里是……\n"
"小南：冥想！\p"
"小枫：它能提高特攻……\n"
"小南：还能提高特防！\p"
"小枫：这个招式最适合……\n"
"小南：超能力宝可梦！\p"
"…… …… ……$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:593
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_RegisteredTateAndLiza"
msgid ""
"Registered GYM LEADERS TATE & LIZA\n"
"in the POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""
"道馆馆主小枫和小南\n"
"已登录到宝可梦导航中。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:597
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_TateAndLizaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"TATE: Looks like the bond between you\n"
"and your POKéMON is far stronger than\l"
"the bond that we share as twins.\p"
"LIZA: You will become even stronger!\n"
"We've battled you, so we know.$"
msgstr ""
"小枫：看来你和宝可梦之间的羁绊\n"
"比我们双胞胎之间的羁绊\l"
"还要牢固得多。\p"
"小南：你会变得更强的！\n"
"和你对战过，所以我们知道。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:604
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_TateAndLizaNeedTwoMons"
msgid ""
"TATE: Hehehe… Were you surprised?\p"
"LIZA: That there are two GYM LEADERS?\p"
"TATE: Oops, you have only one…\n"
"LIZA: POKéMON that can battle.\p"
"TATE: We can't battle that way!\p"
"LIZA: If you want to challenge us,\n"
"bring some more POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"小枫：嘿嘿嘿……吓了一跳吧？\p"
"小南：道馆馆主竟然有两个人？\p"
"小枫：哎呀，你只有一只……\n"
"小南：能战斗的宝可梦。\p"
"小枫：这样我们没法对战！\p"
"小南：想挑战我们的话，\n"
"就多带些宝可梦来吧。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:613
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue"
msgid "MOSSDEEP CITY POKéMON GYM$"
msgstr "绿岭市宝可梦道馆$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:616
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_GymStatueCertified"
msgid ""
"MOSSDEEP CITY POKéMON GYM\p"
"LIZA AND TATE'S CERTIFIED TRAINERS:\n"
"{PLAYER}$"
msgstr ""
"绿岭市宝可梦道馆\p"
"小南和小枫认可的训练家：\n"
"{PLAYER}$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:621
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_TateAndLizaPreRematch"
msgid ""
"TATE: POKéMON…\n"
"LIZA: POKéMON…\p"
"TATE: By changing the party's mix…\n"
"LIZA: The battle style changes.\p"
"TATE: But me…\n"
"LIZA: But me…\p"
"TATE: I'll always be with LIZA!\n"
"LIZA: I'll always be with TATE!\p"
"TATE: Our combination…\n"
"LIZA: We'll show you again and again!$"
msgstr ""
"小枫：宝可梦……\n"
"小南：宝可梦……\p"
"小枫：只要改变队伍的组合……\n"
"小南：对战风格就会改变。\p"
"小枫：但是我……\n"
"小南：但是我……\p"
"小枫：会永远和小南在一起！\n"
"小南：会永远和小枫在一起！\p"
"小枫：我们的组合……\n"
"小南：要让你见识一次又一次！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:633
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_TateAndLizaRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"TATE: You and your POKéMON…\n"
"LIZA: It's as if you were siblings!$"
msgstr ""
"小枫：你和你的宝可梦……\n"
"小南：就像兄弟姐妹一样！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:637
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_TateAndLizaPostRematch"
msgid ""
"TATE: You can knock us down,\n"
"but we'll never stay down!\p"
"LIZA: Because the two of us,\n"
"we always support each other!$"
msgstr ""
"小枫：你可以把我们打倒，\n"
"但我们绝不会一蹶不振！\p"
"小南：因为我们两个人\n"
"总是互相支持！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_Gym/scripts.inc:643
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_TateAndLizaRematchNeedTwoMons"
msgid ""
"TATE: You're back again…\n"
"LIZA: You're back again…\p"
"TATE: To give us a rematch.\n"
"LIZA: To give us a rematch.\p"
"TATE: But…\n"
"LIZA: For our match…\p"
"TATE: You brought just one POKéMON!\n"
"LIZA: You brought just one POKéMON!\p"
"TATE: We need you to bring at least…\n"
"LIZA: Two POKéMON when you come back.$"
msgstr ""
"小枫：你又来了……\n"
"小南：你又来了……\p"
"小枫：来和我们再战一场。\n"
"小南：来和我们再战一场。\p"
"小枫：但是……\n"
"小南：要和我们对战……\p"
"小枫：你只带了一只宝可梦！\n"
"小南：你只带了一只宝可梦！\p"
"小枫：下次来的时候，至少要……\n"
"小南：带两只宝可梦来哦。$"
